# Docstrings on the second declaration of a constant or function

A constant or function declared twice in metadata blocks is documented by its
first declaration, whichever it is.

> Module Doc_on_second_declaration

```catala-metadata
## On the first declaration: documented.
declaration f content integer
  depends on x content integer, y content integer
```

```catala-metadata
## On the second declaration: error.
declaration f content integer
  depends on
    x content integer,
    ## On an argument of the second declaration: error.
    y content integer
  equals x + y
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala doc --no-wrap -o -
┌─[ERROR]─ 1/2 ─
│
│  This constant or function is declared twice in metadata
│  blocks: its documentation must be on the first declaration.
│
├─➤ tests/doc/bad/doc_on_second_declaration.catala_en:15-16:
│    │
│ 15 │ ## On the second declaration: error.
│    │ ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
├─ Docstrings on the second declaration of a constant or function
│
│ First declaration
├─➤ tests/doc/bad/doc_on_second_declaration.catala_en:10.13-14:
│    │
│ 10 │ declaration f content integer
│    │             ‾
└─ Docstrings on the second declaration of a constant or function
┌─[ERROR]─ 2/2 ─
│
│  This constant or function is declared twice in metadata
│  blocks: its documentation must be on the first declaration.
│
├─➤ tests/doc/bad/doc_on_second_declaration.catala_en:19.5-20.1:
│    │
│ 19 │     ## On an argument of the second declaration: error.
│    │     ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
├─ Docstrings on the second declaration of a constant or function
│
│ First declaration
├─➤ tests/doc/bad/doc_on_second_declaration.catala_en:10.13-14:
│    │
│ 10 │ declaration f content integer
│    │             ‾
└─ Docstrings on the second declaration of a constant or function
#return code 123#
